        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE tacikulupusya ŵandu ŵakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mŵende kwa AMBUJE kuti ampe ula mu ndaŵi jakupanda. Jwalakwejo ni jwakusagwisya ula ja miwumbi pa ŵandu ŵakwe, soni jwalakwejo akusamesya mbeju mu mgunda wa jwalijose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Milungu jakupanganya ni yala jikusaŵeceta ya unami, soni ŵakulondola cisango akusayiwona ya unami. Ŵakusasagamila sagamisi akusasagamila ya unami, nipo maloŵe gawo gakusisimisya mtima gakusaŵa gangali mate. Myoyo ŵandu akusagamba kwenda kwawula aku na kuku mpela ngondolo, akusalaga ligongo lyakusoŵa mkucinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE akuŵeceta kuti, “Natumbilile ŵakucinga, nipo acimlongola ŵa mcilambomo tinjapa cilango. Une AMBUJE Ŵamaciligosope tinjisisamalila ngondolo syangu, gopolela kuti liŵasa lya Yuda, ni tinjisitenda kuŵa mahaci ga ngondo gamacili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwa jemanjajo timucikopoka mlongola jwele jutaciŵa mpela liganga lya pandumba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mpela ukunje wa ngondo. Acimlongola wosope ŵakulamulila tacityocela mwa jwalakwejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu wosope ŵa ku Yuda taciŵa ŵakupunda mpela asilikali uŵapondelesye amagongo ŵawo m'matope. Taciputa ngondo ligongo lyakuti AMBUJE taciŵa ali ni jemanjajo, nipo tacapunda amagongo ŵakukwela pa mahaci.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
